# Icons (Lucide)

All UI icons come from [Lucide](https://lucide.dev/icons/). Do not use emoji as chrome/action icons, other icon packs (Font Awesome, Heroicons, Material, …), or Lucide loaded from a CDN script.

## Design (`design/`)

- Copy SVG into `design/assets/icons/<lucide-name>.svg` (kebab-case Lucide name, e.g. `sun.svg`, `moon.svg`)
- Keep Lucide stroke defaults; color via CSS
- Prefer inline SVG with `currentColor` when the icon must follow theme/text color; use `<img src="assets/icons/….svg">` when a fixed asset is enough

## Frontend (`frontend/`)

- Use `lucide-react` components only (`import { Sun } from "lucide-react"`)
- Size and stroke via props / `className`
- Do not vendor raw SVG trees under `frontend/` for icons already in Lucide
- On handoff, match design filenames to PascalCase components (`sun.svg` → `Sun`)
